    "en": {
      "name": "A Journey Back to the Light - \"Zenet\"",
      "effect": "Show 2 or 3 Normal Monster Cards in your hand, Deck, face-up field, and/or GY, then apply the appropriate effect based on the number shown, then if you showed a card(s) in the hand, you can draw 1 card.\n\u25cf 2: Special Summon 1 Level 8 or lower non-Effect Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck as a Normal Monster Card.\n\u25cf 3: Special Summon 1 \"Zenet\" monster from your Deck or 1 Normal Monster from your GY.\nYou can only activate 1 \"A Journey Back to the Light - \"Zenet\"\" per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
